# MasterGrow design system

Selected direction: Botanical Atelier (design-shotgun option A).

Forest #173e32 navigation and actions; warm #f7f8f2 canvas; #fffefa paper; lime #d7ed9e selected navigation. Display titles use locally bundled Libre Caslon Display; interface text uses DM Sans. Fine borders, modest corner radii, quiet botanical SVG decoration. Screens are task-oriented, with Upload media as the main entry point.

Desktop: 244px persistent sidebar, 73px context header, flexible content. Tablet reduces sidebar and stacks overview regions. At 760px and below, sidebar is hidden from visual and accessibility navigation until opened; scrim closes it. Native dialogs trap focus and support Escape. Text status accompanies color; visible focus and reduced-motion styles are present.

Empty accounts show real zero counts and useful next actions. Do not fill empty libraries with fake records, fictitious customers, or invented AI analyses. AI states must distinguish configured, queued, processing, blocked, failed and draft.

Explorations saved in C:/Users/jayny/.gstack/projects/zapp/designs/mastergrow/variant-a.png (selected), variant-b.png and variant-c.png. Generated UI images are design studies, not product screenshots. Implemented screenshots live in docs/screenshots.
